        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bunston/{size}/1939_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-09-26T22:04:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>While I am very excited with what I've seen so far, I never buy a board game without playing it (or at least seeing it played) first. I'd love to see a video of a full game being played before the Kickstarter is over, is there any indication this will happen?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Also, I had someone tell me that some people have been able to play the game over at d20. If anyone here is planning on playing Spirit Island on d20 would you mind if I sit in and watch?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>EDIT: Wow, just saw the print and play on their kickstarter. Totally missed it before, looks like I can take a look myself! I would still like to see a group of experiecned players go at it though.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:33.155Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
